{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690010/extras/box_04.png?t=1746667421\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690010/extras/white_02.png?t=1746667421\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If hallucinations appear but do not persist, you are safe. Open the door to receive medicine from the visitor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690010/extras/white_03.png?t=1746667421\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the hallucinations do not disappear and won't fade, take the pill by the door to escape the dangerous hallucinations immediately.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you follow this properly for <strong>8 days</strong>, your condition may improve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>They say I suffer from schizophrenia.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I don\u2019t remember when the illness began, nor when the headaches first took hold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hallucinations, I'm used to them. But when those hallucinations stop fading away, taking over what's real, it\u2019s a different story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>I must close the door.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Caught between reality and illusion, are you ready to face what's on the other side?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Who's at the Door?</strong> is a short horror game (about 60 minutes) inspired by psychological walking sims like <i>'The Exit 8'</i>. It allows you to experience the hallucinatory phenomena of the protagonist with psychosis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690010/extras/Calender.gif?t=1746667421\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CONTENT WARNING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game includes themes or visuals not appropriate for all ages or workplace environments : Violence, general mature content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690010?t=1746667421","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690010?t=1746667421","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690010/db837510adfc39a026b32951acf77e6bb3fce23c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746667421","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690010/db837510adfc39a026b32951acf77e6bb3fce23c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746667421","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690010/extras/box_04.png?t=1746667421\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690010/extras/white_02.png?t=1746667421\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If hallucinations appear but do not persist, you are safe. Open the door to receive medicine from the visitor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690010/extras/white_03.png?t=1746667421\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the hallucinations do not disappear and won't fade, take the pill by the door to escape the dangerous hallucinations immediately.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you follow this properly for <strong>8 days</strong>, your condition may improve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>They say I suffer from schizophrenia.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I don\u2019t remember when the illness began, nor when the headaches first took hold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hallucinations, I'm used to them. But when those hallucinations stop fading away, taking over what's real, it\u2019s a different story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>I must close the door.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Caught between reality and illusion, are you ready to face what's on the other side?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Who's at the Door?</strong> is a short horror game (about 60 minutes) inspired by psychological walking sims like <i>'The Exit 8'</i>. It allows you to experience the hallucinatory phenomena of the protagonist with psychosis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690010/extras/Calender.gif?t=1746667421\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CONTENT WARNING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game includes themes or visuals not appropriate for all ages or workplace environments : Violence, general mature content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":[" SKONEC Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690010/0f806f79ec822e9b3b6832b29afcc36cd7f64c3a/header.jpg?t=1746667421","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","reco